==Description==
The '''Shamrock Crate''' is an event crate. It has eight skins in total. It was released to coincide with St. Patrick's Day 2026. Two of the skins return from expired codes, while six are new.

The '''Shamrock Crate''' is a pot of gold chest with golden and green accents with clover badge on front. A lock can be fround at the top of the chest, which can be opened with a clover-shaped gold key and unfurling the cover around it.

